ears on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 154% of normal in February to March but only 61% in July to August. So far in 2026 March to April sits at 48% on the middle. Grid 20277 had its driest year in 1980 at 68% of normal.</p>"}
